<title>HUNGARY: Hungary O/N rates end steady at 19.625/75 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary O/N rates end steady at 19.625/75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's overnight interest rates ended steady on Thursday in a quiet market, dealers said.</p>
<p>Overnight rates closed at 19.625/19.75 percent from Wednesday's 19.75 percent.</p>
<p>Hungary's overnight rates tend to hover around the central bank's benchmark one-week reverse repo rate, currently at 20.00 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
